<title>UK: First Chicago NBD sets $300 mln seven-year frn..</title>
<headline>First Chicago NBD sets $300 mln seven-year frn..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST CHICAGO NBD CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *11.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     7.5 BP    PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.833    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.833</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE ON ANY COUPON DATE AFTER YEAR FOUR.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, DIRECT, UNCONDITIONAL AND UNSECURED</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF ANEMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
